%%{init: {'theme':'default','themeVariables':{'background':'#ffffff'}}}%%
flowchart LR
    CUST["1. Customer<br/>Unique code, active, has address"]
    DRAFT["2. Draft order<br/>One line per product, positive whole qty,<br/>price max 2 decimals, server-calculated totals"]
    CONF["3. Confirmed<br/>Reference, products, qty, price, address frozen<br/>All demand Unallocated: U = Q"]
    ALLOC{"4. Allocate - explicit action<br/>Stock for EVERY line?"}
    FAIL["Allocation failed<br/>All earlier line reservations rolled back<br/>U = Q, R = 0"]
    RETRY["5. Retry<br/>New stock arrives, user runs allocation<br/>again with a NEW action reference"]
    RES["Allocated<br/>R = Q, U = 0"]
    CLAIM["Planned on draft trip<br/>Logistics claim"]
    DISP["6. Dispatched by Logistics<br/>R to T: T = Q<br/>Cancel NOT allowed from here"]
    DELIV["7. Delivered by Logistics<br/>T to D: D = Q"]
    DONE(["Completed<br/>only when D = Q"])
    REMOVE["Remove draft-trip claim first"]
    CANCEL(["8. Cancelled<br/>Whole order, with reason<br/>Release reservations + cancel in ONE transaction<br/>C = Q"])

    CUST --> DRAFT
    DRAFT -->|Confirm| CONF
    CONF --> ALLOC
    ALLOC -->|No| FAIL
    FAIL --> RETRY
    RETRY --> ALLOC
    ALLOC -->|Yes| RES
    RES -->|Logistics plans trip| CLAIM
    CLAIM -->|Trip dispatched| DISP
    DISP -->|Driver records full delivery| DELIV
    DELIV --> DONE

    CONF -->|Cancel| CANCEL
    FAIL -->|Cancel| CANCEL
    RES -->|Cancel| CANCEL
    CLAIM -->|Cancel requested| REMOVE
    REMOVE --> CANCEL

    classDef sales fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1e40af,color:#000000
    classDef logistics fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#000000
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#000000
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#000000
    class CUST,DRAFT,CONF,ALLOC,RES,RETRY sales
    class CLAIM,DISP,DELIV,REMOVE logistics
    class FAIL,CANCEL bad
    class DONE good
